Output demo.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 560
Set Padding 30
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "export PATH=/tmp/wbin:$PATH WHATSIT_HOME=/tmp/wdemo; clear" Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "whatsit index ~/Desktop/PROPIEDASH-PINES/14-STAND" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 6s
Type "clear" Enter Sleep 500ms

Type "whatsit used qr-portal/propiedash-qr-enlaces.png 'the QR we printed for the stand'" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "whatsit -n 1 'the QR I printed for the stand'" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 5s
